{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to the Incredible World of the Bibites!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bibites is an Artificial Life Simulation with the ambitious goal of proving that life does not have to be carbon based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/DenseHerb_3.gif?t=1741726333\" />Join The Bibites community in using the power of evolution to create digital creatures of unlimited complexity.  Each Bibite has a unique brain and genetic information that evolves over generations. What will your Bibites become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Sand Box Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own digital worlds using various physical and biological parameters then populate them with bibite save files or templates. Play a benevolent god by assisting your bibites in their struggle for survival, or challenge them with desert like conditions where only the best can survive. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/World_Create_Low.png?t=1741726333\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolution in Real time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch as your world explodes with diverse life!  Through the pressures of natural selection, bibites evolve to fill various environmental roles including predation and parasitism.  With their Neural Network brains and pheromone system they can even learn to communicate and work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/Parasite_Explode.gif?t=1741726333\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/PredBrain_2.gif?t=1741726333\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lifeform Engineering</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If natural selection is too slow, you can now create your very own bibites with the in game editor tool.\u00a0 Tinker with every aspect of their genetic information and brains to create the ultimate lifeform</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/brain_editor_512.png?t=1741726333\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/gene_editor_512.png?t=1741726333\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Analyze</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the secrets hidden within your worlds with various in-game tools. Follow your Bibite's ancestral journey with family trees and lineage views, or, analyze the population's stats and genetic information over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/Lineage_tree_Low.png?t=1741726333\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/Entities_Count_Graph_Low_512.png?t=1741726333\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/Size_Distribution_Graph_Low.png?t=1741726333\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your Bibite's strength by submitting them to Challenge Levels, where they compete in diverse trials or against bosses, unlocking new content, achievements, and a chance to dominate the community leaderboards.  Will your bibite reign supreme?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/extras/challenge_512.png?t=1741726333\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bibite Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalypse Challenge - 1 Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/46a9824cdb214ab64b98231f7f712bbfd73ba759.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalypse Challenge - 2 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/132dd56c723a0ff92659c90966cbe029d5c244b4.jpg"},{"name":"Apocalypse Challenge - 3 Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/b978016ff31357d2cf695083723f8d9a9faa61ee.jpg"},{"name":"Master Manipulator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"Einstein","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"Does anyone smell bacon?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"The Elder among us","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"},{"name":"The Matriarch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2736860/570bf02d3f5eac8223dd3072d12a190a956475e7.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2736860?t=1741726333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741726333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741726333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741726333","categ